<p>7.15 &deg;C</p>

</div><div mt-section-origin="Bookshelves/General_Chemistry/Exercises:_General_Chemistry/Exercises:_OpenStax/05.E:_Thermochemistry_(Exercises)" class="mt-section" id="section_18"><span id="Q5.1.10"></span><h3 id="Q5.1.10-42016">Q5.1.10</h3>

<p>A piece of unknown substance weighs 44.7 g and requires 2110 J to increase its temperature from 23.2 &deg;C to 89.6 &deg;C.</p>

